{"lines":[{"c":1,"h":0.014534883469061177,"x":0.10172744778511365,"y":0.049418604763883822,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.11708253224690753},{"y":0.097383721054090655,"c":1,"x":0.10364682520289704,"t":"Our volunteer Consuela is an amazing woman. She has difficulty walking herself, but she","w":0.69097890218098956,"h":0.014603660535361218},{"w":0.72360844930013024,"t":"doesn't let that stop her. She helps a couple of people with similar difficulties, who had almost","x":0.1017274451545065,"h":0.014657765457682825,"y":0.11324921115792597,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"stopped walking altogether. By using herself as an example, Consuela encourages them to","x":0.10172745522532532,"y":0.12933753915000767,"h":0.014557809558952584,"w":0.70441457112630212},{"y":0.14565129918850217,"t":"walk more and more.","w":0.1673771286010742,"h":0.01442115494881524,"x":0.10155287780969388,"c":1},{"y":0.16849354095714164,"t":"Minh visits a young man who lives alone and can't leave his home on his own, so he hardly","x":0.10360730312725337,"w":0.70257909138997388,"c":1,"h":0.017441771835182696},{"t":"ever saw anyone. But together they go out to the cinema, or to see friends the young man","y":0.1860465117507224,"x":0.10364684200483007,"h":0.014584402932729668,"w":0.69289825439453123,"c":1},{"t":"hadn't been able to visit for a long time.","h":0.013249211356466839,"c":1,"w":0.3071017201741536,"y":0.20189274441891825,"x":0.10364683654318455},{"y":0.22523659287561704,"t":"Tanya visits an elderly woman once a week. When the woman found out that Tanya is a","x":0.10364684346893833,"w":0.675623779296875,"h":0.014588988391382784,"c":1},{"x":0.10172745464299321,"w":0.71017272949218757,"h":0.01613417965380548,"t":"professional dressmaker, she got interested. Tanya showed her some soft toys she'd made,","y":0.24127906972089552,"c":1},{"w":0.675623779296875,"h":0.015988372176979682,"t":"and the woman decided to try it herself. And now she really enjoys it, and spends hours","x":0.10172745979494058,"y":0.25726744165860316,"c":1},{"x":0.10172745474896014,"w":0.71017272949218746,"c":1,"y":0.27318611987074237,"t":"making toys. They're not perhaps up to Tanya's standard yet, but she gains a lot of pleasure","h":0.016088328075709812},{"w":0.034548943837483748,"t":"Q16","h":0.013081394761142562,"y":0.1293604653737892,"c":1,"x":0.83493282165131577},{"w":0.034548943837483637,"y":0.18459302351118656,"c":1,"x":0.83493282165696092,"h":0.013081394761142673,"t":"Q17"},{"t":"Q18","y":0.25726744211583774,"x":0.83493282165696092,"w":0.034548943837483637,"c":1,"h":0.013081394761142673},{"x":0.10364682470795022,"t":"Alexei is a volunteer with a family that faces a number of difficulties. By calmly talking over","y":0.31388012597087211,"w":0.69673706054687501,"h":0.014608245994014335,"c":1},{"y":0.3299418604207659,"c":1,"w":0.72168904622395835,"x":0.1017274537602763,"t":"possible solutions with family members, he's helping them to realise that they aren't helpless,","h":0.01611492205117393},{"t":"and that they can do something themselves to improve their situation. This has been great for Q19","w":0.76785868326822915,"x":0.10167594599082008,"y":0.34388943255897531,"c":1,"h":0.018317824282480744},{"t":"their self-esteem.","h":0.015631039135087565,"y":0.36094990906720648,"w":0.13880968729654947,"x":0.10143023132933369,"c":1},{"w":0.68330134073893223,"y":0.38662790726843999,"t":"And the last volunteer I'll mention, though there are plenty more, is Juba. She volunteers","x":0.10364683431724463,"h":0.013081394761142562,"c":1},{"x":0.10172744658317261,"c":1,"t":"with a teenage girl with learning difficulties, who wasn't very good at talking to other people.","y":0.40252365949963997,"w":0.70633397420247401,"h":0.016088328075709812},{"x":0.10172744985466219,"t":"Juba's worked very patiently with her, and now the girl is far better at expressing herself, and Q20","y":0.41860465111880896,"w":0.7677543131510417,"h":0.01609566444854249,"c":1},{"w":0.24041470845540364,"c":1,"h":0.017299724302081265,"t":"at understanding other people","x":0.10151115827306882,"y":0.43328129264793036},{"h":0.014638507855051275,"t":"OK, I hope that's given you an idea of what volunteering is all about. Now I'd like ...","y":0.46075581407699229,"x":0.10556621538449017,"w":0.63915547688802088,"c":1},{"x":0.10364683294187269,"t":"SECTION 3","y":0.52034883715680547,"w":0.14971209208170574,"h":0.015988372176979571,"c":1},{"y":0.55083930923506397,"t":"LIZZIE:","w":0.046094071070353196,"h":0.011693474321335273,"c":1,"x":0.10171304150925752},{"w":0.032629556655883796,"y":0.56831395346548552,"t":"JOE:","h":0.010174418548680175,"x":0.10172744807320971,"c":1},{"x":0.10361382508138092,"y":0.59876501496759005,"w":0.044211889902750656,"c":1,"h":0.011772295353164486,"t":"LIZZIE:"},{"x":0.099808061910432802,"y":0.61482558152567857,"c":1,"w":0.034548943837483734,"h":0.013081394761142673,"t":"JOE:"},{"c":1,"y":0.67877906962585377,"w":0.044145873387654605,"t":"LIZZIE:","h":0.010174418548680175,"x":0.10364683345972353},{"x":0.10172744648015369,"h":0.0087209304424490375,"w":0.032629559834798177,"c":1,"t":"JOE:","y":0.69622093010035979},{"w":0.042226486206054695,"h":0.010174418548680286,"c":1,"x":0.10364683357643524,"t":"LIZZIE:","y":0.74418604651648956},{"h":0.01162790725659868,"t":"JOE:","y":0.76017441841186972,"w":0.03454894383748372,"x":0.099808061583264773,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.80668604651283848,"w":0.046065257390340175,"x":0.10172744796913943,"h":0.010174418548680175,"t":"LIZZIE."},{"w":0.03454894383748372,"c":1,"x":0.099808061824060434,"t":"JOE:","h":0.010174418548680286,"y":0.83720930225182266},{"w":0.6123890177408855,"c":1,"y":0.54939066787193547,"h":0.017595516770420039,"x":0.19571541315392077,"t":"So how are you getting on with your teaching practice at the High School, Joe?"},{"x":0.1956785505832524,"t":"Well I've been put in charge of the school marching band, and it's quite a","h":0.017882876591727603,"y":0.56552819912770114,"w":0.562572275797526,"c":1},{"h":0.014627503596645774,"c":1,"x":0.1938579660708652,"t":"responsibility. I'd like to talk it over with you.","y":0.58284883732918069,"w":0.34165067036946611},{"h":0.014633922396398158,"c":1,"x":0.19769673863079504,"t":"Go ahead. You'd better start by giving me a bit of background.","y":0.59873817049723399,"w":0.47984644571940105},{"t":"OK. Well the band has students in it from all years, so they're aged 11 to 18,","x":0.19577736037592389,"c":1,"y":0.61482558135072352,"h":0.016089245047102962,"w":0.59117080688476564},{"y":0.63081395360681447,"t":"and there are about 50 of them altogether. It's quite a popular activity within the","w":0.61228408813476565,"x":0.19577734157778801,"h":0.014611913879587046,"c":1},{"h":0.019907971812347491,"c":1,"t":"school. I've never worked with a band of more than 20 before, and this is very","x":0.19565821045766246,"y":0.64380250190676813,"w":0.60103123982747397},{"c":1,"t":"different.","x":0.19563746123608969,"h":0.015338761723756145,"w":0.071297054290771517,"y":0.66238875865213998},{"y":0.67752755063981973,"t":"I can imagine.","x":0.19527104529094416,"w":0.11228455861409506,"c":1,"h":0.01528234271220974},{"h":0.015878717079523597,"t":"They aren't really good enough to enter national band competitions, but they're in","y":0.69375809067655914,"x":0.19762864435120009,"w":0.62584426879882815,"c":1},{"y":0.70956602086099507,"t":"a regional one later in the term. Even if they don't win, and I don't expect them to, Q22","x":0.19569446244564992,"w":0.67386688232421876,"h":0.018849930026177741,"c":1},{"h":0.015988372176979682,"x":0.19385797046465061,"w":0.43953933715820326,"t":"hopefully it'il be an incentive for them to try and improve.","y":0.72674418600043378,"c":1},{"h":0.014826498422712886,"c":1,"t":"Yes, hopefully.","x":0.19577735407279828,"y":0.74258675077249359,"w":0.11516314188639321},{"y":0.75863344617035022,"w":0.6085553487141927,"h":0.016367490509707094,"t":"Well, now the town council's organising a carnival in the summer, and the band","x":0.19571864357287108,"c":1},{"w":0.036468331019083644,"c":1,"y":0.76017441886002368,"h":0.013081394761142673,"t":"Q23","x":0.83301343516224313},{"h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.19577734306721897,"y":0.77470930261663351,"c":1,"w":0.59500961303710942,"t":"has been asked to perform. If you ask me, they aren't really up to it yet, and I"},{"y":0.78870192485140567,"x":0.19571208937220491,"h":0.015445895751567962,"c":1,"w":0.5490855407714843,"t":"need to get them functioning better as a band, and in a very short time."},{"x":0.19564115184085779,"w":0.57800445556640634,"y":0.8037183705844041,"t":"Have you been doing anything with them? Apart from practising the music,","h":0.019356048295174455,"c":1},{"t":"I mean.","x":0.19520851646584267,"w":0.062558015187581389,"h":0.01225866684778254,"c":1,"y":0.8209055504223115},{"h":0.016103000821375391,"t":"I played a recording I came across, of a drummer talking about how playing in a","c":1,"x":0.19193857857637037,"w":0.61036468505859376,"y":0.83720930227834389},{"c":1,"t":"Q24","x":0.83301343516224313,"y":0.83866279095304708,"h":0.013081394761142673,"w":0.036468331019083644},{"w":0.60668411254882804,"y":0.85231357324353652,"c":1,"h":0.017133662828511587,"x":0.19378074871073675,"t":"band had changed his life. I think it was an after-dinner speech. I thought it was"},{"w":0.62188100179036454,"x":0.1938579635005083,"h":0.014534883469061066,"c":1,"y":0.87063953500740554,"t":"pretty inspiring, because being in the band had stopped him from getting involved"},{"t":"in crime. The students seemed to find it interesting, too.","x":0.19568710226154176,"h":0.015103896709646736,"w":0.42628547668457029,"c":1,"y":0.88480673434505186},{"x":0.099808060887344521,"w":0.036468331019083658,"t":"110","h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1,"y":0.95494186072262643}],"h":3170,"w":2400}